  annotation = {中文辅助译名：通过挠曲电效应多场耦合模型模拟局部机械应力引起的铁电极化极化切换},
}

@misc{panorama_2f5d281f71cb_dc682943a23d982e,
  title = {A Sparsity Adaptive Compressive Sampling Matching Pursuit Algorithm},
  author = {Xiangpu Liu and Feng Yang and Xiang Yi and Lili Guo},
  year = {2015},
  doi = {10.2991/978-94-6239-145-1_18},
  url = {https://doi.org/10.2991/978-94-6239-145-1_18},
  howpublished = {Atlantis Press eBooks},
  annotation = {中文辅助译名：一种稀疏自适应压缩采样匹配追踪算法},
  abstract = {In the area of compressed sensing (CS), the compressive sampling matching pursuit (CoSaMP) algorithm offers a theoretical reconstruction guarantee in noise environment by exploiting a backtracking framework. But it relies on the sparsity of signal. With a stage by stage reconstruction structure, the sparsity adaptive matching pursuit (SAMP) algorithm can reconstruct signals when the sparsity is unknown. By taking both advantages of CoSaMP and SAMP, we propose a greedy algorithm for reconstruction of sparse signals, called the sparsity adaptive compressive sampling matching pursuit (SACoSaMP). The proposed algorithm can reconstruct signals without prior information of sparsity, and it is robust to noise. In this paper, we give a residual upper bound of the proposed SACoSaMP algorithm, and demonstrate the performance of it through simulation experiments.},
}

@misc{panorama_2f5d281f71cb_691ac2b496c31eaa,
  title = {Multilevel quantizer design for decentralized detection in wireless sensor networks},
  author = {Fei Gao and Lili Guo and Hongbin Li and Jun Liu and Jun Fang},
  year = {2015},
  doi = {10.1109/chinasip.2015.7230498},
  url = {https://doi.org/10.1109/chinasip.2015.7230498},
  howpublished = {IEEE China Summit and International Conference on Signal and Information Processing (ChinaSIP)},
  annotation = {中文辅助译名：用于无线传感器网络中分散检测的多级量化器设计},
  abstract = {We consider the problem of distributed detection involving multiple sensor nodes to jointly detect the presence of an unknown signal. To circumvent power/bandwidth constraints, a multilevel quantizer is employed in each sensor to quantize the original observation. The quantized data are transmitted through distortion channels to a fusion center where a generalized likelihood ratio test (GLRT) detector is employed to perform a global decision. We propose a quantizer design approach by maximizing the Fisher information with respect to the quantization thresholds. Numerical results demonstrate that with 2- or 3-bit quantization, the GLRT detector can provide detection performance very close to that of the unquantized GLRT detector which uses the original observations without quantization.},
}

@misc{panorama_2f5d281f71cb_a412a2fa14994e86,
  title = {Weighted soft decision of QPSK modulation in parallel combinatory spread spectrum system},
  author = {Xiaofei Jiang and Lili Guo and Ming-Duo Liu and Xiang-Pu Liu},
  year = {2014},
  doi = {10.1109/ursigass.2014.6929270},
  url = {https://doi.org/10.1109/ursigass.2014.6929270},
  howpublished = {URSI General Assembly and Scientific Symposium},
  annotation = {中文辅助译名：并行组合扩频系统中QPSK调制的加权软判决},
  abstract = {In parallel combinatory spread spectrum (PCSS) system, the soft decision of QPSK modulation will make the superposed Pseudo-Noise (PN) sequences lose its correlation, which leads to the failure of the demodulation. According to the characteristics of QPSK modulation, the superposed sequence is mapped to two sequences, and then a new weighed summation algorithm is proposed to keep the correlation properties of superposed sequences. Applying the algorithm in QPSK modulation in PCSS system, soft decision can be obtained in the receiver. This weighed soft decision resolves the problem that conventional soft decision QPSK modulation cannot apply in PCSS system. The system model is built and simulated in the paper. The simulation results show that the reliability of proposed soft decision QPSK modulation is better than that of hard decision QPSK modulation and this method is useful in engineering application.},
}

@misc{panorama_2f5d281f71cb_4718614d3f26bdcf,
  title = {A spectrum trading algorithm using an agent in cognitive radio networks},
  author = {Shibing Zhang and Guodong Zhang and Yonghong Chen and Lili Guo},
  year = {2014},
  doi = {10.1109/icumt.2014.7002132},
  url = {https://doi.org/10.1109/icumt.2014.7002132},
  howpublished = {International Congress on Ultra Modern Telecommunications and Control Systems and Workshops (ICUMT)},
  annotation = {中文辅助译名：认知无线电网络中使用代理的频谱交易算法},
  abstract = {To design an efficient and efficient cognitive radio networks, the related technical and economic aspects should be needed to be considered. In this paper, an effective algorithm is proposed to address the spectrum trading in cognitive radio networks where there are multiple primary services (sellers), multiple secondary users (buyers) and one agent. In the algorithm, every secondary user competes with each other in terms of the spectrum demand quantity for the agent. And then, Nash equilibrium is used as the solution of the game. When the agent gets the information of total spectrum demand quantity, it buys spectrum from the sellers according to their prices. Each seller dynamically adjusts the price according to its supply function and the spectrum demand of the agent. Market-Equilibrium price is considered as the optimal solution where there is no excess spectrum in the trading market. Simulation results showed that the proposed algorithm is effective.},
}

@misc{panorama_2f5d281f71cb_765d7f4f623ab0aa,
  title = {Quantizer Design for Distributed GLRT Detection of Weak Signal in Wireless Sensor Networks},
  author = {Fei Gao and Lili Guo and Hongbin Li and Jun Liu and Jun Fang},
  year = {2014},
  doi = {10.1109/twc.2014.2379279},
  url = {https://doi.org/10.1109/twc.2014.2379279},
  howpublished = {IEEE Transactions on Wireless Communications},
  annotation = {中文辅助译名：无线传感器网络中微弱信号分布式GLRT检测的量化器设计},
  abstract = {We consider the problem of distributed detection of a mean parameter corrupted by Gaussian noise in wireless sensor networks, where a large number of sensor nodes jointly detect the presence of a weak unknown signal. To circumvent power/bandwidth constraints, a multilevel quantizer is employed in each sensor to quantize the original observation. The quantized data are transmitted through binary symmetric channels to a fusion center where a generalized likelihood ratio test (GLRT) detector is employed to perform a global decision. The asymptotic performance analysis of the multibit GLRT detector is provided, showing that the detection probability is monotonically increasing with respect to the Fisher information (FI) of the unknown signal parameter. We propose a quantizer design approach by maximizing the FI with respect to the quantization thresholds. Since the FI is a nonlinear and nonconvex function of the quantization thresholds, we employ the particle swarm optimization algorithm for FI maximization. Numerical results demonstrate that with 2- or 3-bit quantization, the GLRT detector can provide detection performance very close to that of the unquantized GLRT detector, which uses the original observations without quantization.},
}

@misc{panorama_2f5d281f71cb_b9f3bd600e0e0346,
  title = {Multi-tensor completion for estimating missing values in video data},
  author = {Chao Li and Lili Guo and Andrzej S Cichocki},
  year = {2014},
  doi = {10.1109/scis-isis.2014.7044738},
  url = {https://doi.org/10.1109/scis-isis.2014.7044738},
  howpublished = {Joint International Conference on Soft Computing and Intelligent Systems and International Symposium on Advanced Intelligent Systems (SCIS&ISIS)},
  annotation = {中文辅助译名：用于估计视频数据中缺失值的多张量补全},
  abstract = {Many tensor-based data completion methods aim to solve image and video in-painting problems. But, all methods were only developed for a single dataset. In most of real applications, we can usually obtain more than one dataset to reflect one phenomenon, and all the datasets are mutually related in some sense. Thus one question raised whether such the relationship can improve the performance of data completion or not? In the paper, we proposed a novel and efficient method by exploiting the relationship among datasets for multi-video data completion. Numerical results show that the proposed method significantly improve the performance of video in-painting, particularly in the case of very high missing percentage.},
}

@misc{panorama_2f5d281f71cb_988df078994869f7,
  title = {Research on LFM and voice SSB signal transmission system in same bandwidth},
  author = {Lili Guo and Zhiguo Sun and Yan Zhai and Xiaoyan Ning},
  year = {2014},
  doi = {10.1049/ic.2014.0113},
  url = {https://doi.org/10.1049/ic.2014.0113},
  howpublished = {International Conference on Wireless Communications, Networking and Mobile Computing},
  annotation = {中文辅助译名：LFM与语音SSB信号同带宽传输系统研究},
  abstract = {For the problem of increasingly scarce spectrum resources, improving bandwidth efficiency is to be solved. Drawing on traditional techniques based on CDMA (Code Division Multiple Access, CDMA) communication, this paper puts forward a transmission system in the same bandwidth of LFM and voice SSB signal. Theoretical analysis and simulation results showed that LFM and voice SSB signal can be transmitted in the same bandwidth, LFM can be demodulated by non-coherent demodulation method which is FrFT transform and be filtered in the FrFT domain, thus to finish the separate and demodulation of LFM and voice SSB signal.},
}

@misc{panorama_2f5d281f71cb_162d5489fe81a3f6,
  title = {Correlation of Symmetric Raised Cosine Keying Signals},
  author = {Lili Guo and Bin Zhou and Zhiguo Sun and Xiangpu Liu},
  year = {2013},
  doi = {10.3724/sp.j.1146.2011.01361},
  url = {https://doi.org/10.3724/sp.j.1146.2011.01361},
  howpublished = {JOURNAL OF ELECTRONICS INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY},
  annotation = {中文辅助译名：对称升余弦键控信号的相关性},
  abstract = {对称升余弦键控(Symmetric Raised Cosine Keying, SRCK)调制是一种新型的二进制数字调制方法，通过改变频率变化曲线的极性来载荷信息。SRCK信号相位连续，频率变化平滑，具有能量集中度高、频带利用率高、抗幅度衰落能力强等特点。为了分析SRCK信号的通信性能，对SRCK信号波形样本的自相关系数和互相关系数表达式进行了推导，找到用第一类贝塞尔函数来推导其解析表达式的方法，并通过仿真验证，进一步分析了影响其相关值变化的因素。提出一种正交的SRCK调制方法，并对其特性进行了分析，为下一代高效调制通信系统的实现提供了一种新的途径。},
}

@misc{panorama_2f5d281f71cb_511e02262d63d5f0,
  title = {Combination of hearing screening and genetic screening for deafness-susceptibility genes in newborns},
  author = {Gendong Yao and Shouxia Li and Dingli Chen and Haiqin Feng and Subin Zhao and YONG-JIE LIU and Lili Guo and Zhiming Yang and Xiaofang Zhang and Caixia Sun and Zehui Wang and Weiyong Zhang},
  year = {2013},
  doi = {10.3892/etm.2013.1406},
  url = {https://doi.org/10.3892/etm.2013.1406},
  howpublished = {Experimental and Therapeutic Medicine},
  annotation = {中文辅助译名：听力筛查与新生儿耳聋易感基因遗传筛查相结合},
  abstract = {The aim of this study was to determine the clinical significance of the results of screening of newborn hearing and the incidence of deafness-susceptibility genes. One thousand newborn babies in the Handan Center Hospital (Handan, China) underwent screening of hearing and deafness-susceptibility genes. The first screening test was carried out using otoacoustic emissions (OAEs). Babies with hearing loss who failed to pass the initial screening were scheduled for rescreening at 42 days after birth. Cord blood was used for the screening of deafness-susceptibility genes, namely the GJB2, SLC26A4 and mitochondrial 12S rRNA (MTRNR1) genes. Among the 1,000 neonates that underwent the first hearing screening, 25 exhibited left-sided hearing loss, 21 exhibited right-sided hearing loss and 15 cases had binaural hearing loss. After rescreening 42 days later, only one of the initial 61 cases exhibited hearing loss under OAE testing. The neonatal deafness gene tests showed two cases with 1555A>G mutation and two cases with 1494C>T mutation of the MTRNR1 gene. In the SLC26A4 gene screening, four cases exhibited the heterozygous IVS7-2A>G mutation and one case exhibited heterozygous 1226G>A mutation. In the GJB2 gene screening, two cases exhibited the homozygous 427C>T mutation and 10 exhibited the heterozygous 235delC mutation. The genetic screening revealed 21 newborns with mutations in the three deafness-susceptibility genes. The overall carrier rate was 2.1% (21/1,000). The association },
}

@misc{panorama_2f5d281f71cb_4cd22b2278ad42f3,
  title = {Orthogonality of sinusoidal non-linear chirp keying signals},
  author = {Lili Guo},
  year = {2013},
  url = {https://oversea.cnki.net/kcms/detail/detail.aspx?dbcode=CJFD&filename=JLGY201302044},
  howpublished = {Journal of Jilin University},
  annotation = {中文辅助译名：正弦非线性线性调频键控信号的正交性},
  abstract = {In order to obtain orthogonal signal set of Sinusoidal Non-linear Chirp Keying(SNCK),the mathematical correlation integral expression is derived,and solution to give an analytical formula with the Bessel function is found.Analysis of the orthogonality of SNCK signals with different period number of frequency variation curve,different time-bandwidth product and different frequency modulation polarity shows that the SNCK method can implement orthogonal modulation by flexibly selecting modulation parameters.A scheme to search for orthogonal signal set of SNCK is provided,which lays a foundation for multi-carrier parallel communication using SNCK signals.},
}

@misc{panorama_2f5d281f71cb_4bdd4332f15b8425,
  title = {Novel mutations ofSLC26A4in Chinese patients with nonsyndromic hearing loss},
  author = {Gendong Yao and Dingli Chen and Huijun Wang and Shouxia Li and Jin Zhang and Zhixing Feng and Lili Guo and Zhiming Yang and Su-Jun Yang and Caixia Sun and Xiaofang Zhang and Duan Ma},
  year = {2013},
  doi = {10.3109/00016489.2013.777160},
  url = {https://doi.org/10.3109/00016489.2013.777160},
  howpublished = {Acta Oto-Laryngologica},
  annotation = {中文辅助译名：中国非综合征性听力损失患者SLC26A4的新突变},
  abstract = {CONCLUSIONS: This study demonstrated high prevalence of GJB2, SLC26A4, and mtDNA A1555G mutations in Chinese patients with nonsyndromic hearing loss and discovered eight novel mutations in SLC26A4. Most of these novel mutations were predicted pathogenic variants. OBJECTIVES: Nonsyndromic hearing loss is the most common neurosensory deafness where the majority of patients have highly diversified genetic defects. This study aimed to define the genetic profile of deafness in a Chinese population with potential to discover novel mutations. METHODS: A total of 227 segregating deaf students and 200 individuals with normal hearing were enrolled. With the Sanger sequencing chemistry, direct sequencing was performed on entire coding regions of GJB2, GJB3, SLC26A4, and mtDNA m.C1494T and m.A1555G. RESULTS: Direct sequencing analysis revealed that 53 (23.35%) of 227 patients carried at least 1 mutant allele in GJB2, 40 (17.62%) patients in SLC26A4, 5 (2.20%) patients in mtDNA A1555G, and 1 (0.44%) patient in mtDNA C1494T mutations. Four patients carried three unclassified mutations in GJB3 genes. Overall 38 mutant variants were detected in this cohort of patients, including 8 novel mutations in SLC26A4. The eight novel variants were six missense substitutions (p.V163L, p.G222S, p.A456D, p.N457I, p.C466Y, p.F667L), one nonsense mutation (p.W472X), and one frameshift (p.Asn612Ilefs×23).},
}

@misc{panorama_2f5d281f71cb_69080c82a057ad97,
